{"1661600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Ink", "steam_appid": 1661600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend the tower</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead ink is a top-down soulslike set inside a single hand-crafted vertical world. You awaken at the summit of a hostile brutalist tower. To escape, you must find a way down. Explore a dense, nonlinear structure of shortcuts, locked routes, hidden drops and dangerous ledges. The tower is not a backdrop: understanding its shape is at the heart of the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/8f7cb281992e5ef549f3432397fde543.poster.avif?t=1784674402\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/8f7cb281992e5ef549f3432397fde543.webm?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/8f7cb281992e5ef549f3432397fde543.mp4?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Print your next life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies yield ink. Printers turn it into your body, weapons and equipment, and form a network of checkpoints throughout the tower. Spend heavily on a powerful loadout, preserve your ink for future attempts, or risk transporting it to another printer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/b5deb71529830e0e2fb71234e58b73ef.poster.avif?t=1784674402\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/b5deb71529830e0e2fb71234e58b73ef.webm?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/b5deb71529830e0e2fb71234e58b73ef.mp4?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the ink last</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every death has a material cost. Die too often or spend too freely and your ink supply can run dry, ending the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliberate melee combat with blocking, parrying, rolling, and plunge attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nonlinear entirely hand-crafted tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons, enemies, and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden routes, shortcuts, and blueprint upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the year 2207 the quantum state of your brain was encoded in a stream of photons and beamed into the cosmos. A pioneer of a glorious new age of light-speed travel, destined for fame and glory... at least that was the plan.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend the tower</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead ink is a top-down soulslike set inside a single hand-crafted vertical world. You awaken at the summit of a hostile brutalist tower. To escape, you must find a way down. Explore a dense, nonlinear structure of shortcuts, locked routes, hidden drops and dangerous ledges. The tower is not a backdrop: understanding its shape is at the heart of the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/8f7cb281992e5ef549f3432397fde543.poster.avif?t=1784674402\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/8f7cb281992e5ef549f3432397fde543.webm?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/8f7cb281992e5ef549f3432397fde543.mp4?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Print your next life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies yield ink. Printers turn it into your body, weapons and equipment, and form a network of checkpoints throughout the tower. Spend heavily on a powerful loadout, preserve your ink for future attempts, or risk transporting it to another printer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/b5deb71529830e0e2fb71234e58b73ef.poster.avif?t=1784674402\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/b5deb71529830e0e2fb71234e58b73ef.webm?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/extras/b5deb71529830e0e2fb71234e58b73ef.mp4?t=1784674402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the ink last</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every death has a material cost. Die too often or spend too freely and your ink supply can run dry, ending the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliberate melee combat with blocking, parrying, rolling, and plunge attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nonlinear entirely hand-crafted tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons, enemies, and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden routes, shortcuts, and blueprint upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the year 2207 the quantum state of your brain was encoded in a stream of photons and beamed into the cosmos. A pioneer of a glorious new age of light-speed travel, destined for fame and glory... at least that was the plan.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Descend a dense, interconnected brutalist tower in this top-down soulslike built around exploration. Harvest ink from enemies, then spend it to print your body, weapons and equipment. Every death costs ink; run out, and the run ends.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“The title uses a ton of Dark Souls-inspired mechanics but takes players to a very different world, defined by its verticality... Dead Ink is a game with strong mechanics and a cool unique idea.”<br>Softpedia<br><br>“The addictingly simple gameplay is complimented incredibly well by a unique idea and a phenomenal presentation.”<br>Try Hard Guides<br><br>“That tower is the star of the show, really - a winding, labyrinthine structure that can be poked and prodded at from any direction. There's something particularly special about games that commit to creating a single, super-dense location to slowly untangle.”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/header.jpg?t=1784674402", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784674402", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661600/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784674402", "website": "https://offwidthgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><stro